The '''Great Ice Wall''' is a location in the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}}. It serves as the barrier between the {{Zone|Dwarven Mines}} and {{Zone|Glacite Tunnels}}.

== Overview ==
The '''Great Ice Wall''' can be accessed through {{Zone|Divan's Gateway}} from the {{Zone|Cliffside Veins}}, the {{Zone|Goblin Burrows}} from the {{Zone|Far Reserve}}, or the {{Zone|Aristocrat Passage}} through the {{Zone|Royal Mines}}.

{{MobSprite|Glacite Walker}}s spawn in the '''Great Ice Wall'''. The {{Zone|Dwarven Base Camp}} can be seen beyond the wall, and can be accessed by giving the {{NPCSprite|Station Master}} a {{Item|Secret Railroad Pass}}.

